{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05273","headline":"奉和幸大荐福寺 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和幸大荐福寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝地龙飞後，金身佛现时。\n千花开国界，万善累皇基。\n北阙承行幸，西园属住持。\n天衣拂旧石，王舍起新祠。\n刹凤迎琱辇，幡虹驻彩旗。\n同沾小雨润，窃仰大风诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}